                    <h1 class="c-article-title" data-test="article-title" data-article-title="">Sediment records of lake eutrophication and oligotrophication under the influence of human activity and climate warming in the Urals metallurgical region (Russia)</h1>

                    <ul class="c-article-identifiers">
                        
        <li class="c-article-identifiers__item" data-test="article-category">Primary Research Paper</li>
    
    

                        <li class="c-article-identifiers__item">
                            Published: <time datetime="2023-03-04">04 March 2023</time>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
